<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">Tita</book>
  <para style="h">Tita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tita</para>
  <para style="mt">Tita</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul Pasian suohpa leh Pasian mi telte ginna dungzui leh Pasian ngaisahna banga thutah theina lam a, Jesu Khrist sawltah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zuou theilou Pasian in hun kipat masang peh a achiemsa kumtawn hinna kinepna ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian i hundampa uh thupieh dungzui a, ka kunga kepsah a um thu genzahna ziehin ahuntah ah athu pen suhlat in aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ginna ka tankhawmpi ka tapa tahtah, Tita kungah, Pa Pasian leh i hundampa Jesu Khrist akipat hepina, khotuona leh lungmuonna na kung ah umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamte zieh a nang Kret tuikuolkhum gam a ka hing nuasie ahi, nasep zawlou a umte na sep zou na ding leh ka hing thupieh banga khochin a upate na guot thei na dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi khat genbanglou, zi khat nei, atate Pasian gingta, tatselou leh phengphilou ahi teitei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hattuom lamkai pen Pasian gou kempa ahiziehin genbanglou, mi kiliensah hilou, lungthah bailou, zu dawnlou, miphawhtat hilou, sum met dei a huoiham mi hilou ahi ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi kiphal, sil hoi dei mi, lungsim dih, mi dihtat, mi siengthou, mi kidehthei ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thugin toh kituoh pomtah thute dettaha tudet mi ahi ding hi, tuachi’n thudih ama na kihilsa akipat, mi dangte ahantawh theina ding leh thudih anielkal dan uh ahilchien theina dinga thuhil na dih a tudet ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen mi phengphi, thuginalou gente leh mi solhat tampite a um uhi, adieh in teptante lah a mi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabang mite kam humpieh ding ahi, metna dihlou adei man un, ahillou dinguh thuhilnate ahil ua, mi innkuon sung a tohbuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaute lah a guolnei khat in, “Kret mite pen zuou gente, gamsa giloute, thasie anhaite ahi uh,” chiin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam theipina adih ahi, tuaziehin ginna lam a alamzan theina ding un amaute khautah in vauhil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judate tangthu bulbal neiloute abuoipi louna dingun thuhil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi siengthoute adingin sil zousie asiengthou hi, hinanleh mi bua leh gingloute adingin bangma asieng a um sih hi, alungsimte u’leh asie leh pha theina nangawn uh sienglou ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasian ka thei chiin akam un aphuong ua, hinanleh a nasep un Ama anuol uhi, mi kidah huoite, thumang loute, na hoi sem dinga chinglou ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh nang pen in thugin dihtah toh kituoh thute genin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi upa lamte lungsim dihtah, zatat huoi, kidehthei leh ginna dihtah, itna leh thuohhatna nei mi hi ding in thuhil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuamabangin nupi upa lamte, a umdan ua zatat huoi, mi gensiet hatlou, zu hailou, ahoilam pouma thuhilmi hi zaw dingin thuhil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachia amauten nupi khanglaite, apasalte it ding leh atate uh it dinga athuhil theina ding un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kidehthei, telelou, innsung nasem mi, mi navah, apasalte uh thu manga um ding leh Pasian thu kigente gensiet a aum louna dinga, thu ahil theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabangmain tangvalte pen lungsim dihtah nei dingin, hanthawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sil zousie ah nna hoi sema etton dingin nangma kimusah inlen, thugin ah sietna a umlou dan, azatat huoi dan leh asetheilou ahidan kilangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thudih gen mawsahthei guollou ahi dan theisah inlen, tuachia alangpangten na tunga silgilou gen ding neilou a azum theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suohte khu apute uh thu mang ding, sil zousie a akipahna lam ua um dingin leh mi dawn hatlou dingin thu hil inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian i hundampa uh thuhilna thu khu, sil zousie a azep hoi theina ding ua khut them neilou a, muonhuoina zousie sulang zaw dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen hundamna hing tut Pasian hepina khu mi zousie kungah, ahing kilangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua hepina in Pasian ngaisah louna leh leitung utnate tawpsan a, tulai hun a, lungsim sieng leh dihtat tah a gamta ding leh, Pasian ngaisah a hing dingin eite ahing hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua kinepna kilawp huoi leh i Pasian thupi leh ihundampa Jesu Khrist hing kilahna ding thupitah ngah in i um ding uh chi ahing hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Danbei a gamtatna chintenga kipat a eite ahing tat theina ding leh, nna hoi sem a phatuomngai leh, Ama teltuom mite ihi thei na dinga hing siengsah dingin eite a dingin Ama ahing kipeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam thute gen inlen, thuneitah in, hanthawn kawm in vauhil in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama u’khu vaihawmte leh thuneitute nuoi a kitulut a, thumang ding leh silhoi chinteng bawl dinga mansa a um dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Koima genselou dingin, kihau kisel tawpsan dingin, nunnem a, mizousie kunga kingaingiemna ensah dingin hilpha kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen eite zong masang lai in, mimote, thumang loute, sola umte, utna gilou leh nopsahna tuomtuom suoh leh sal a na taangte ina hi ua, gilou leh kithangsieta umte, kimuda leh ki ensante tualeh khat leh khat kimudatuote ina hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh mihing lam a Pasian i hundampa uh lungsiet na leh itna ahing kilat tahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dihtatna nasep eiten ina bawlte zieh hilou in, Ama khotuona dungzui in eite ahing hundamta hi, tua hundamna pen Hagau Siengthou zieh a pienthana a silsiengna leh siemtha kiana zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua Hagau Siengthou khu i hundampa Jesu Khrist ziehin itung uah kiningching tahin ahing sungbuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama hepina a siemtansah a um in kumtawn hinna kinepna dungzuiin gouluote hi dinga siem in ium ngei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasian gingtaten silhoi bawl ding ngaituo u’heh chi thu amuonhuoi ahi, tualeh tam thute khautah a na gen zing dingin ka dei hi. Tamte pen mihingte dingin ahoi a, tualeh aphatuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh kihauna mot huoite, khangthu sutte, kinielnate, leh danthua kikalnate kihepmangsan in, aziehpen tamte sil phatuomlou leh mannabei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kikhenna piengsah mi pen khatvei nivei na vauhil nua in kikuppi nawn sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabang mi pen lampiel khiel ahia, ama leh ama kimawpai ahi chi na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Artema ahiei, ahisihleh Tikikus ahiei, na kunga kang sawl chiengin, Nikopoli khuo ah, ka kungah hing pei teitei in. Tua mun a phalbi sung um dingin thukhenna ka bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dan siempa Zena leh Apollo akhuolzinna ding uah bangma kitasamlou in na peisah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh i mite’n nisim a atahsapte uh asuhtuo thei na ding u’leh gasuo loua a umlou na dingun, silhoi bawl dingin kizilsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka kunga umte zousie in ahing nousiet uhi. Ginna a, eite hing itte ka nousiet hi hing na gen pieh in. Noute zousie kungah hepina umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
